# AssumesComplete for every kind (AUDIT-CHANGES #75; criteria section 7):
# an assume nesting that holds only a type is checked too. `Nope` is not
# in scope.
# Verdicts: oracle accepts; native accepts; Audit before accepts (only a
# val's, fn's, method's, context's or functor's nesting was formed); now
# rejects (T's nesting does not form). Class B.
assume Nope { type T; }
